      "text": "YOUR COMPETITOR CHANGED THEIR PRICES. WHEN WILL YOU FIND OUT?\n\nCompetitor monitoring is easy to postpone when you're handling sales, projects and email yourself.\n\nYou can delegate the research to AI. Start with three websites and ask it to record current services, public prices https://t.co/0IBugCldLC https://t.co/oiid9ukXgR",
