        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 2
      },
      "text": "They look the same, but OpenAI’s Dots, Meta’s Muse, and xAI’s Grok Bot are building completely different agent models:\n\n🔹 OpenAI Dots: An always-on worker built into ChatGPT to manage ongoing workflows across Slack, GitHub, and Teams.\n\n🔹 Meta Muse: Built for personal, everyday https://t.co/0gs9w58uAx",
      "url": "https://x.com/Driving_Impact/status/2110777727938928830"
    },
    {
      "article": {
        "title": "AI Is Not a Zero-Sum Game"
      },
      "author_id": "1310626233898561537",
      "created_at": "2026-10-15T15:08:50.000Z",
