        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 3,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "I wanted to create an arcade game with my two kids as the heroes, built to run on my arcade cabinet with MAME.\n\nSo I started building Ethan &amp; Ari: Last Ember with dot, @OpenAI's  personal assistant, using GPT SOL 6.1 with high reasoning effort. All the development was done https://t.co/aFrPlJSPWH",
