      "text": "if you want to play around with some of these AI services which use persistent virtual machines and internet access to do things for you (like ChatGPT Dots, Meta Muse, etc.)\n\nbut are loathe to give it access to your primary e-mail (which frankly you should be imo)\n\nmy",
      "url": "https://x.com/DCinvestor/status/2110662874154905733"
