        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 1
      },
      "text": "To integrate 30+ brokers into @openalgoHQ , I had to open 30+ trading accounts.\n\nThat triggered compliance and surveillance checks across brokers.\n\nI ended up receiving emails from every single broker, asking why one person needs so many trading accounts.\n\nExplaining the same https://t.co/lJ346gfnF2",
