      },
      "text": "We just launched PersonalAgentEval!🚀🚀🚀 (https://t.co/gpewuZpOVw) The first benchmark built to evaluate personal agents across diverse users, preferences, and domains!\n\nWe benchmarked 7 popular personal agents across everyday workflows (e.g. booking dinners, paying bills, https://t.co/BhmgSfGksA",
