      "text": "I’ve been trying so hard to switch to GrokBot (@bot) that I built 8 agents. Separate topics, a coder, a designer, a PM. The orchestration is genuinely impressive.\n\nBut somehow I built an entire team and still miss having a personal assistant.\n\nThe reasoning feels weaker, tasks",
