          "id": "2110347509948146070",
          "type": "quoted"
        }
      ],
      "text": "OPUS 5.5 + OPENAI DOTS built a marketing agent that brings a product its first 1,000 clients in 7 days, and it’s f**king unreal\n\nit’s basically reverse-engineering a whole marketing team and packing it into one agent with 9 parts and 2 models\n\nOpus 5.5 is the brain. it picks the https://t.co/M2QYXpgSjO https://t.co/cDYt4nyTSG",
