        "retweet_count": 5
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2109707079594176967",
          "type": "quoted"
        }
      ],
      "text": "BRUTAL.\n\nI was paying $12,614 a year to hear \"NO.\"\n\nThat's the bill for letting Claude Opus 5.5 read every 1-minute BTC candle. My 3-seat desk gets the same final call for $394.\n\nMost people wire their smartest model straight to the chart and make it think about every candle. On https://t.co/DE2K2n5yqc https://t.co/MDO3koHLiO",
      "url": "https://x.com/alpha404ai/status/2110417097419628894"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "15578396",
      "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:10:40.000Z",
