      "id": "2110357624244052360",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 47,
        "like_count": 1,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 2,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "Now some upsides to @bot vs @Muse and @ChatGPT Dots, Bot Teams, I made a clunky but effective content creation workflow with Muse and Dots, Grok I just told my main bot what I wanted it spun up a 3 bot team, and so far the sample run I have them doing is on par. @elonmusk",
